{"id":"6680b15c-aea8-406f-90e5-b79cf82c0220","object":"chat.completion","created":1785005922,"model":"deepseek-v4-flash","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"{\n  \"implementation\": \"def solve(case):\\n    nodes = case['nodes']\\n    core = case['core_distance']\\n    distances = case['distances']\\n    \\n    # Build mutual reachability edges\\n    edges = []\\n    for u, v, d in distances:\\n        w = max(core[u], core[v], d)\\n        # Canonicalize: store with u < v\\n        if u < v:\\n            edges.append((w, u, v))\\n        else:\\n            edges.append((w, v, u))\\n    \\n    # Sort by weight, then by first node, then by second node\\n    edges.sort(key=lambda x: (x[0], x[1], x[2]))\\n    \\n    # Union-Find\\n    parent = {node: node for node in nodes}\\n    rank = {node: 0 for node in nodes}\\n    \\n    def find(x):\\n        while parent[x] != x:\\n            parent[x] = parent[parent[x]]\\n            x = parent[x]\\n        return x\\n    \\n    def union(x, y):\\n        rx, ry = find(x), find(y)\\n        if rx == ry:\\n            return False\\n        if rank[rx] < rank[ry]:\\n            parent[rx] = ry\\n        elif rank[rx] > rank[ry]:\\n            parent[ry] = rx\\n        else:\\n            parent[ry] = rx\\n            rank[rx] += 1\\n        return True\\n    \\n    n = len(nodes)\\n    mst_edges = []\\n    total_weight = 0.0\\n    \\n    for w, u, v in edges:\\n        if union(u, v):\\n            mst_edges.append([u, v, w])\\n            total_weight += w\\n            if len(mst_edges) == n - 1:\\n                break\\n    \\n    if len(mst_edges) != n - 1:\\n        raise ValueError(\\\"Graph is disconnected\\\")\\n    \\n    return {\\n        'mst_edges': mst_edges,\\n        'total_weight': total_weight\\n    }\"\n}","reasoning_content":"We need to write solve(case) function that implements HDBSCAN mutual reachability MST. The case payload has nodes list, core_distance dict (node->float), distances list of [node1, node2, distance]. We compute mutual reachability for each pair: max(core_u, core_v, distance). Then build MST using Kruskal's algorithm: sort edges by mutual reachability, then by endpoint IDs (alphabetically). Use union-find. Ensure graph is connected. Return {\"mst_edges\": list of [u,v,weight], \"total_weight\": sum of weights}. Use deterministic sorting, ignore nonce, etc.\n\nImplementation details: parse nodes, create union-find dict, for each distance pair compute mutual reachability, store as (weight, u, v) but canonicalize u<v. Sort by (weight, u, v). Then iterate, union, add to mst_edges until n-1 edges. If not enough edges, raise ValueError.\n\nMake sure to not mutate input. Return exactly as required.\n\nWrite Python code as string.\n\nNow produce final JSON response with key \"implementation\"."},"logprobs":null,"finish_reason":"stop"}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":2017,"completion_tokens":737,"total_tokens":2754,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":1920},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":234},"prompt_cache_hit_tokens":1920,"prompt_cache_miss_tokens":97},"system_fingerprint":"fp_8b330d02d0_prod0820_fp8_kvcache_20260402"}